source('tuas-port','大士港第一期填海完成','First Phase of Tuas Port Reclamation Works Completes','Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore','https://www.mpa.gov.sg/media-centre/details/first-phase-of-tuas-port-reclamation-works-completes','已開啟二〇二一年十一月公告，確認第一期沉箱與地盤改良；不將不同期數或泊位營運日期混為一談。','Opened November2021 release confirms Phase1 caissons and ground improvement; phases and operational milestones are kept distinct.','Opened turn196view0; published30November2021, Phase1 fabrication/installation context.',2021)
source('tuas-history','大士港沉箱施工里程碑','Tuas Port caisson milestones','Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore','https://www.mpa.gov.sg/who-we-are/about-mpa/mpas-milestones','官方里程碑列二〇一六年首座沉箱；專案日期與本課原創受力數據分開。','Official milestones list the first caisson in2016; project dates are distinct from original synthetic load calculations.','Official search turn195search7; first installed29April2016.',2016)
source('tuas-last','大士港第一期末座沉箱','Final Caisson Installed for Tuas Terminal Phase1','Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore','https://www.mpa.gov.sg/media-centre/details/final-caisson-installed-for-tuas-terminal-phase-1','二〇一九年公告記錄第一期最後沉箱；不據此聲稱全港同年完工。','The2019 release records the final Phase1 caisson, not completion of the entire port that year.','Official search turn195search17 and turn195search20 confirm23April2019.',2019)
source('piles','樁基礎設計手冊','Design of Pile Foundations EM1110-2-2906','US Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.publications.usace.army.mil/Portals/76/Publications/EngineerManuals/EM_1110-2-2906.pdf','官方書目確認一九九一年一月手冊，涉及調查、試驗與樁基設計；歷史方法參考不等於現行場址允收標準。','Official catalogue confirms January1991 guidance on exploration, testing and pile design; historical methodology is not a current site acceptance criterion.','Official indexed PDF turn195search48 and catalogue turn195search3.',1991)
source('la-wharf','洛杉磯港碼頭重建','Berths177–182 Wharf Restoration','Port of Los Angeles','https://portoflosangeles.org/references/2025-news-releases/news_061825_wharf_restoration','港務機關記錄二〇二三年開始與二〇二五年完成重建；議程明列混凝土樁及新碼頭，不使用本課假設樁徑冒稱實績。','Authority records2023 construction start and2025 completion; official agenda identifies concrete piles, without substituting synthetic dimensions for project facts.','Official search turn196search21 and turn196search20 confirm restoration and piles.',2025)
source('pakkok','南丫島北角碼頭改善背景','Pak Kok Pier on Lamma Island','Hong Kong CEDD','https://www.cedd.gov.hk/eng/our-projects/topics-in-focus/index-id-37.html','官方列碼頭改善計畫首個完成項目；僅比較公共碼頭功能，不推定本課鋼管樁型式。','Authority identifies the first completed Pier Improvement Programme project; used for public-access comparison, without asserting the course steel-pile type.','Official search turn196search9 and legislative table turn196search45 record commissioningNovember2022.',2022)
